h --><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":1} -->\\n<h1 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">BeanChilling helps farmers map farms and profile coffees with clarity.<\\/h1>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"lede\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"lede\\\">BeanChilling is an improved GIS-based application currently in development. The platform combines farm mapping and coffee profiling so coffee producers can make better field-level decisions.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"btn-row\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group btn-row\\\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"\\/beanchilling\\/showcase\\/\\\">Explore App Features<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><a class=\\\"btn btn-secondary\\\" href=\\\"\\/beanchilling\\/imrad\\/\\\">Read Research Summary<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:image {\\\"sizeSlug\\\":\\\"full\\\",\\\"linkDestination\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"hero-visual\\\"} -->\\n<figure class=\\\"wp-block-image size-full hero-visual\\\"><img src=\\\"\\/beanchilling\\/wp-content\\/themes\\/beanchilling\\/assets\\/images\\/coffee_farm_main_bg.png\\\" alt=\\\"Coffee farm landscape used as BeanChilling preview image\\\"><\\/figure>\\n<!-- \\/wp:image --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/section>\"},\"elements\":[]}]},{\"id\":\"abef5c47\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_title\":\"Application Purpose\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a9cdec31\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<section id=\\\"application\\\" class=\\\"wp-block-group section\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"page-wrap\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group page-wrap\\\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"eyebrow\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Application Purpose<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\\\"className\\\":\\\"section-title\\\"} -->\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading section-title\\\">What BeanChilling is built to solve<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card-grid three-up\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card-grid three-up\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"app-card-title-row\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group app-card-title-row\\\"><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} -->\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Scattered Farm Records<\\/h3>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"icon-placeholder app-card-icon app-title-icon\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group icon-placeholder app-card-icon app-title-icon\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>Farm boundaries, crop details, and quality notes are often separated across notebooks and different tools.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"app-card-title-row\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group app-card-title-row\\\"><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} -->\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Limited Geographic Insight<\\/h3>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"icon-placeholder app-card-icon app-title-icon\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group icon-placeholder app-card-icon app-title-icon\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>Without GIS context, farmers and researchers struggle to analyze how location and terrain affect coffee characteristics.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"app-card-title-row\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group app-card-title-row\\\"><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} -->\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Hard-to-Track Profiles<\\/h3>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"icon-placeholder app-card-icon app-title-icon\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group icon-placeholder app-card-icon app-title-icon\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>BeanChilling structures coffee profiles in one place so farm records are easier to update, compare, and review over time.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/section>\"},\"elements\":[]}]},{\"id\":\"8b9a0b2d\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_title\":\"Application Overview\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"29d0aefb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<section id=\\\"app-overview\\\" class=\\\"wp-block-group section overview-section\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"page-wrap\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group page-wrap\\\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"eyebrow\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Application Overview<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:columns {\\\"className\\\":\\\"overview-layout\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-columns overview-layout\\\"><!-- wp:column {\\\"className\\\":\\\"overview-intro\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-column overview-intro\\\"><!-- wp:heading {\\\"className\\\":\\\"section-title\\\"} -->\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading section-title\\\">BeanChilling Application Overview<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"lede\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"lede\\\">BeanChilling is a GIS-based platform designed to help coffee farmers map farm locations, organize coffee profile records, and monitor farm data through a practical and structured workflow.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"overview-highlights\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group overview-highlights\\\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><strong>Built for:<\\/strong> Coffee farmers, field validators, and local research teams.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><strong>What it combines:<\\/strong> GIS farm mapping, coffee profiling, and monitoring summaries.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><strong>Why it matters:<\\/strong> More reliable records and faster, evidence-based planning decisions.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"overview-cta\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group overview-cta\\\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"\\/beanchilling\\/showcase\\/\\\">Explore Full Feature Walkthrough<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:column --><!-- wp:column {\\\"className\\\":\\\"overview-feature-column\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-column overview-feature-column\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card overview-card overview-card-primary\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card overview-card overview-card-primary\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"feature-title-row\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group feature-title-row\\\"><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3,\\\"className\\\":\\\"feature-title\\\"} -->\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading feature-title\\\">GIS Farm Mapping<\\/h3>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"icon-placeholder feature-icon-placeholder\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group icon-placeholder feature-icon-placeholder\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>Maps and registers farm boundaries and locations so each farm can be accurately identified and validated.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card overview-card\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card overview-card\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"feature-title-row\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group feature-title-row\\\"><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3,\\\"className\\\":\\\"feature-title\\\"} -->\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading feature-title\\\">Coffee Profiling<\\/h3>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"icon-placeholder feature-icon-placeholder\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group icon-placeholder feature-icon-placeholder\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>Stores coffee profile information and links each profile to specific mapped farms for traceable records.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card overview-card\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card overview-card\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"feature-title-row\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group feature-title-row\\\"><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3,\\\"className\\\":\\\"feature-title\\\"} -->\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading feature-title\\\">Monitoring Insights<\\/h3>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"icon-placeholder feature-icon-placeholder\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group icon-placeholder feature-icon-placeholder\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>Provides consolidated summaries to support field monitoring, reporting, and local planning initiatives.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:column --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:columns --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/section>\"},\"elements\":[]}]},{\"id\":\"0bc84924\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_title\":\"Research Team\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b712b9c8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<section class=\\\"wp-block-group section alt\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"page-wrap split\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group page-wrap split\\\"><!-- wp:group -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group\\\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"eyebrow\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Research Team<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\\\"className\\\":\\\"section-title\\\"} -->\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading section-title\\\">Meet Zenith<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"lede\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"lede\\\">Zenith is the IT research and development team behind BeanChilling. The team blends GIS, agricultural research, and software engineering to support more informed coffee production.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"team-academy-note\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"team-academy-note\\\">\\\"The Philippine coffee industry has recently demonstrated significant growth with increased production rates and rising global demand for traceable and ethically sourced coffee products. In response to these developments, our BSIT team Zenith with the project BeanChilling, from Saint Louis University, School of Accountancy, Management, Computing, and Information Studies, proposes the enhancement of BREWQEN, a GIS-based modular coffee profiling mobile application designed to digitally document and geotag Benguet coffee farms.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><a class=\\\"text-link\\\" href=\\\"\\/beanchilling\\/team\\/\\\">View researchers and developers<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"team-mini-grid\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group team-mini-grid\\\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"mini-card\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"mini-card\\\">GIS Research<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"mini-card\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"mini-card\\\">Field Validation<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"mini-card\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"mini-card\\\">Data Profiling<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"mini-card\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"mini-card\\\">App Development<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/section>\"},\"elements\":[]}]}]'),(860,45,'_elementor_page_settings','a:11:{s:13:\"system_colors\";a:4:{i:0;a:3:{s:3:\"_id\";s:7:\"primary\";s:5:\"title\";s:7:\"Primary\";s:5:\"color\";s:7:\"#6EC1E4\";}i:1;a:3:{s:3:\"_id\";s:9:\"secondary\";s:5:\"title\";s:9:\"Secondary\";s:5:\"color\";s:7:\"#54595F\";}i:2;a:3:{s:3:\"_id\";s:4:\"text\";s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"Text\";s:5:\"color\";s:7:\"#7A7A7A\";}i:3;a:3:{s:3:\"_id\";s:6:\"accent\";s:5:\"title\";s:6:\"Accent\";s:5:\"color\";s:7:\"#61CE70\";}}s:13:\"custom_colors\";a:0:{}s:17:\"system_typography\";a:4:{i:0;a:5:{s:3:\"_id\";s:7:\"primary\";s:5:\"title\";s:7:\"Primary\";s:21:\"typography_typography\";s:6:\"custom\";s:22:\"typography_font_family\";s:6:\"Roboto\";s:22:\"typography_font_weight\";s:3:\"600\";}i:1;a:5:{s:3:\"_id\";s:9:\"secondary\";s:5:\"title\";s:9:\"Secondary\";s:21:\"typography_typography\";s:6:\"custom\";s:22:\"typography_font_family\";s:11:\"Roboto Slab\";s:22:\"typography_font_weight\";s:3:\"400\";}i:2;a:5:{s:3:\"_id\";s:4:\"text\";s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"Text\";s:21:\"typography_typography\";s:6:\"custom\";s:22:\"typography_font_family\";s:6:\"Roboto\";s:22:\"typography_font_weight\";s:3:\"400\";}i:3;a:5:{s:3:\"_id\";s:6:\"accent\";s:5:\"title\";s:6:\"Accent\";s:21:\"typography_typography\";s:6:\"custom\";s:22:\"typography_font_family\";s:6:\"Roboto\";s:22:\"typography_font_weight\";s:3:\"500\";}}s:17:\"custom_typography\";a:0:{}s:21:\"default_generic_fonts\";s:10:\"Sans-serif\";s:9:\"site_name\";s:12:\"BeanChilling\";s:19:\"page_title_selector\";s:14:\"h1.entry-title\";s:15:\"activeItemIndex\";i:1;s:11:\"viewport_md\";i:768;s:11:\"viewport_lg\";i:1025;s:32:\"colors_enable_styleguide_preview\";s:3:\"yes\";}'),(777,138,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"78c20b8f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_title\":\"IMRAD\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"325edc6a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<section class=\\\"wp-block-group section page-hero\\\">\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group page-wrap narrow\\\">\\n\\n<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Research Details</p>\\n\\n\\n<h1>BeanChilling Research Through IMRAD</h1>\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"lede\\\">This page summarizes the research framework and can be expanded with your full manuscript details.</p>\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n</section>\\n\\n\\n<section class=\\\"wp-block-group section\\\">\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group page-wrap\\\">\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card-grid imrad-grid\\\">\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card\\\">\\n\\n<h2>Introduction</h2>\\n\\n\\n<p>Describe the context of coffee farming challenges, GIS opportunities, and why BeanChilling was proposed.</p>\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card\\\">\\n\\n<h2>Methods</h2>\\n\\n\\n<p>Explain data gathering, profiling workflow, mapping techniques, validation process, and development approach.</p>\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card\\\">\\n\\n<h2>Results</h2>\\n\\n\\n<p>Present key findings, app output examples, and indicators showing improved profiling and mapping quality.</p>\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card\\\">\\n\\n<h2>Discussion</h2>\\n\\n\\n<p>Interpret the findings, limitations, practical implications for farmers, and possible future enhancements.</p>\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n</section>\"},\"elements\":[]}]}]'),(146,8,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(147,8,'_elementor_template_type','wp-page'),(148,8,'_elementor_version','3.35.7'),(149,67,'_wp_page_template','default'),(150,67,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(151,67,'_elementor_template_type','wp-page'),(152,67,'_elementor_version','3.35.7'),(153,68,'_wp_page_template','default'),(154,68,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(155,68,'_elementor_template_type','wp-page'),(156,68,'_elementor_version','3.35.7'),(157,8,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"40544f5b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_title\":\"App Showcase\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"79861847\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"shortcode\",\"settings\":{\"shortcode\":\"[bc_section id=\\\"137\\\"]\"},\"elements\":[]}]}]'),(158,69,'_wp_page_template','default'),(159,69,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(160,69,'_elementor_template_type','wp-page'),(161,69,'_elementor_version','3.35.7'),(162,69,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"181b5b56\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4fa472ce\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<!-- wp:group {\\\"tagName\\\":\\\"section\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"section page-hero\\\"} -->\\n<section class=\\\"wp-block-group section page-hero\\\">\\n<!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"page-wrap narrow\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group page-wrap narrow\\\">\\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"eyebrow\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Application Walkthrough<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph -->\\n<!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":1} -->\\n<h1>BeanChilling Feature Showcase<\\/h1>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading -->\\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"lede\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"lede\\\">This page is ready for your app screenshots and feature explanations. Replace placeholder blocks with final images later.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph -->\\n<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group -->\\n<\\/section>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group -->\\n<!-- wp:group {\\\"tagName\\\":\\\"section\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"section\\\"} -->\\n<section class=\\\"wp-block-group section\\\">\\n<!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"page-wrap\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group page-wrap\\\">\\n<!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card-grid showcase-grid\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card-grid showcase-grid\\\">\\n<!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card\\\">\\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"screenshot-placeholder\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"screenshot-placeholder\\\">Screenshot Placeholder<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph -->\\n<!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":2} -->\\n<h2>Farm Mapping Module<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading -->\\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>Show how farmers draw boundaries, geotag locations, and register farm plots.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph -->\\n<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group -->\\n<!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card\\\">\\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"screenshot-placeholder\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"screenshot-placeholder\\\">Screenshot Placeholder<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph -->\\n<!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":2} -->\\n<h2>Coffee Profiling Module<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading -->\\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>Show profile creation, quality descriptors, and farm-linked coffee records.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph -->\\n<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group -->\\n<!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card\\\">\\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"screenshot-placeholder\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"screenshot-placeholder\\\">Screenshot Placeholder<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph -->\\n<!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":2} -->\\n<h2>Insight Dashboard<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading -->\\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>Show summary metrics, map layers, and decision support features for users.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph -->\\n<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group -->\\n<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group -->\\n<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group -->\\n<\\/section>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group -->\\n\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"87b08a9\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"container_type\":\"grid\",\"grid_columns_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":\"2\"},\"grid_rows_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":\"1\"},\"grid_rows_grid_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":\"1\"}},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":false}]'),(483,113,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(164,8,'_elementor_controls_usage','a:2:{s:9:\"shortcode\";a:3:{s:5:\"count\";i:1;s:15:\"control_percent\";i:0;s:8:\"controls\";a:1:{s:7:\"content\";a:1:{s:17:\"section_shortcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"shortcode\";i:1;}}}}s:9:\"container\";a:3:{s:5:\"count\";i:1;s:15:\"control_percent\";i:0;s:8:\"controls\";a:0:{}}}'),(861,45,'_elementor_data','[]'),(862,144,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(863,144,'_elementor_template_type','kit'),(330,98,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"46f87b22\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"31f92473\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<!-- wp:group {\\\"tagName\\\":\\\"section\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"hero section\\\"} -->\\n<section class=\\\"wp-block-group hero section\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"page-wrap hero-grid\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group page-wrap hero-grid\\\"><!-- wp:group -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group\\\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"eyebrow\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">GIS Coffee Profiling Platform<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":1} -->\\n<h1 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">BeanChilling helps farmers map farms and profile coffees with clarity.<\\/h1>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"lede\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"lede\\\">BeanChilling is an improved GIS-based application currently in development. The platform combines farm mapping and coffee profiling so coffee producers can make better field-level decisions.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"btn-row\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group btn-row\\\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"\\/beanchilling\\/showcase\\/\\\">Explore App Features<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><a class=\\\"btn btn-secondary\\\" href=\\\"\\/beanchilling\\/imrad\\/\\\">Read Research Summary<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:image {\\\"sizeSlug\\\":\\\"full\\\",\\\"linkDestination\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"hero-visual\\\"} -->\\n<figure class=\\\"wp-block-image size-full hero-visual\\\"><img src=\\\"\\/beanchilling\\/wp-content\\/themes\\/beanchilling\\/assets\\/images\\/coffee_farm_main_bg.png\\\" alt=\\\"Coffee farm landscape used as BeanChilling preview image\\\" \\/><\\/figure>\\n<!-- \\/wp:image --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/section>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\\\"tagName\\\":\\\"section\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"section\\\"} -->\\n<section id=\\\"application\\\" class=\\\"wp-block-group section\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"page-wrap\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group page-wrap\\\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"eyebrow\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Application Purpose<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\\\"className\\\":\\\"section-title\\\"} -->\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading section-title\\\">What BeanChilling is built to solve<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card-grid three-up\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card-grid three-up\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"app-card-title-row\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group app-card-title-row\\\"><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} -->\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Scattered Farm Records<\\/h3>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"icon-placeholder app-card-icon app-title-icon\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group icon-placeholder app-card-icon app-title-icon\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>Farm boundaries, crop details, and quality notes are often separated across notebooks and different tools.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"app-card-title-row\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group app-card-title-row\\\"><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} -->\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Limited Geographic Insight<\\/h3>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"icon-placeholder app-card-icon app-title-icon\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group icon-placeholder app-card-icon app-title-icon\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>Without GIS context, farmers and researchers struggle to analyze how location and terrain affect coffee characteristics.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"app-card-title-row\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group app-card-title-row\\\"><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} -->\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Hard-to-Track Profiles<\\/h3>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"icon-placeholder app-card-icon app-title-icon\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group icon-placeholder app-card-icon app-title-icon\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>BeanChilling structures coffee profiles in one place so farm records are easier to update, compare, and review over time.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/section>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\\\"tagName\\\":\\\"section\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"section overview-section\\\"} -->\\n<section id=\\\"app-overview\\\" class=\\\"wp-block-group section overview-section\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"page-wrap\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group page-wrap\\\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"eyebrow\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Application Overview<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:columns {\\\"className\\\":\\\"overview-layout\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-columns overview-layout\\\"><!-- wp:column {\\\"className\\\":\\\"overview-intro\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-column overview-intro\\\"><!-- wp:heading {\\\"className\\\":\\\"section-title\\\"} -->\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading section-title\\\">BeanChilling Application Overview<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"lede\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"lede\\\">BeanChilling is a GIS-based platform designed to help coffee farmers map farm locations, organize coffee profile records, and monitor farm data through a practical and structured workflow.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"overview-highlights\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group overview-highlights\\\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><strong>Built for:<\\/strong> Coffee farmers, field validators, and local research teams.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><strong>What it combines:<\\/strong> GIS farm mapping, coffee profiling, and monitoring summaries.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><strong>Why it matters:<\\/strong> More reliable records and faster, evidence-based planning decisions.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"overview-cta\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group overview-cta\\\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"\\/beanchilling\\/showcase\\/\\\">Explore Full Feature Walkthrough<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:column --><!-- wp:column {\\\"className\\\":\\\"overview-feature-column\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-column overview-feature-column\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card overview-card overview-card-primary\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card overview-card overview-card-primary\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"feature-title-row\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group feature-title-row\\\"><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3,\\\"className\\\":\\\"feature-title\\\"} -->\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading feature-title\\\">GIS Farm Mapping<\\/h3>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"icon-placeholder feature-icon-placeholder\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group icon-placeholder feature-icon-placeholder\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>Maps and registers farm boundaries and locations so each farm can be accurately identified and validated.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card overview-card\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card overview-card\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"feature-title-row\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group feature-title-row\\\"><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3,\\\"className\\\":\\\"feature-title\\\"} -->\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading feature-title\\\">Coffee Profiling<\\/h3>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"icon-placeholder feature-icon-placeholder\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group icon-placeholder feature-icon-placeholder\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>Stores coffee profile information and links each profile to specific mapped farms for traceable records.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"card overview-card\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group card overview-card\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"feature-title-row\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group feature-title-row\\\"><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3,\\\"className\\\":\\\"feature-title\\\"} -->\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading feature-title\\\">Monitoring Insights<\\/h3>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"icon-placeholder feature-icon-placeholder\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group icon-placeholder feature-icon-placeholder\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>Provides consolidated summaries to support field monitoring, reporting, and local planning initiatives.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:column --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:columns --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/section>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\\\"tagName\\\":\\\"section\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"section alt\\\"} -->\\n<section class=\\\"wp-block-group section alt\\\"><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"page-wrap split\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group page-wrap split\\\"><!-- wp:group -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group\\\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"eyebrow\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Research Team<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\\\"className\\\":\\\"section-title\\\"} -->\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading section-title\\\">Meet Zenith<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"lede\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"lede\\\">Zenith is the IT research and development team behind BeanChilling. The team blends GIS, agricultural research, and software engineering to support more informed coffee production.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"team-academy-note\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"team-academy-note\\\">\\\"The Philippine coffee industry has recently demonstrated significant growth with increased production rates and rising global demand for traceable and ethically sourced coffee products. In response to these developments, our BSIT team Zenith with the project BeanChilling, from Saint Louis University, School of Accountancy, Management, Computing, and Information Studies, proposes the enhancement of BREWQEN, a GIS-based modular coffee profiling mobile application designed to digitally document and geotag Benguet coffee farms.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><a class=\\\"text-link\\\" href=\\\"\\/beanchilling\\/team\\/\\\">View researchers and developers<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\\\"className\\\":\\\"team-mini-grid\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group team-mini-grid\\\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"mini-card\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"mini-card\\\">GIS Research<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"mini-card\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"mini-card\\\">Field Validation<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"mini-card\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"mini-card\\\">Data Profiling<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"className\\\":\\\"mini-card\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"mini-card\\\">App Development<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group --><\\/section>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group -->\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"f6d537f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"container_type\":\"grid\",\"grid_columns_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":\"2\"},\"grid_rows_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":\"1\"},\"grid_rows_grid_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":\"1\"}},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":false}]'),(328,98,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(329,98,'_wp_page_template','elementor_theme'),(173,7,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(174,7,'_elementor_template_type','wp-page'),(175,7,'_elementor_version','3.35.7'),(176,72,'_wp_page_template','default'),(177,72,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(178,72,'_elementor_template_type','wp-page'),(179,72,'_elementor_version','3.35.7'),(180,73,'_wp_