 to specific mapped farms for traceable records.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- /wp:group -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"card overview-card\"} -->\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-group card overview-card\">\r\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\r\n<h3>Monitoring Insights</h3>\r\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Provides consolidated summaries to support field monitoring, reporting, and local planning initiatives.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- /wp:group -->\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- /wp:column -->\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- /wp:group -->\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"className\":\"section alt\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group section alt\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"page-wrap split\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group page-wrap split\">\n<!-- wp:group -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">Research Team</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"section-title\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Meet Zenith</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lede\"} -->\n<p class=\"lede\">Zenith is the research and development team behind BeanChilling. The team blends GIS, agricultural research, and software engineering to support more informed coffee production.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/beanchilling/team/\">View researchers and developers</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"team-mini-grid\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group team-mini-grid\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"mini-card\"} -->\n<p class=\"mini-card\">GIS Research</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"mini-card\"} -->\n<p class=\"mini-card\">Field Validation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className