e enhancement of BREWQEN, a GIS-based modular coffee profiling mobile application designed to digitally document and geotag Benguet coffee farms.<br><br>Through this system, Benguet coffee farmers will be able to showcase their farms on digital maps, maintain accurate and variety-specific inventories (Arabica, Robusta, Liberica, and Excelsa), and provide QR-enabled traceability for every batch of coffee produced. This will not only enhance their visibility in local and global markets but also empower them to meet international traceability standards, attract discerning buyers, and build stronger trust with consumers who value authenticity and sustainability.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/beanchilling/team/\">View researchers and developers</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"team-mini-grid\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group team-mini-grid\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"mini-card\"} -->\n<p class=\"mini-card\">GIS Research</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"mini-card\"} -->\n<p class=\"mini-card\">Field Validation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"mini-card\"} -->\n<p class=\"mini-card\">Data Profiling</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"mini-card\"} -->\n<p class=\"mini-card\">App Development</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','13-revision-v1','','','2026-03-08 08:48:20','2026-03-08 08:48:20','',13,'/beanchilling/?p=38',0,'revision','',0),(45,1,'2026-03-17 11:21:45','2026-03-17 11:21:45','','Default Kit','','publish','closed','closed','','default-kit','','','2026-04-27 17:07:17','2026-04-27 17:07:17','',0,'http://localhost/beanchilling/?p=45',0,'elementor_library','',0),(58,0,'2026-03-17 11:57:06','2026-03-17 11:57:06',' ','','','publish',