University, School of Accountancy, Management, Computing, and Information Studies, proposes the enhancement of BREWQEN, a GIS-based modular coffee profiling mobile application designed to digitally document and geotag Benguet coffee farms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"/beanchilling/team/\">View researchers and developers</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"team-mini-grid\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"mini-card\"} -->\n<p>GIS Research</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"mini-card\"} -->\n<p>Field Validation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"mini-card\"} -->\n<p>Data Profiling</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"mini-card\"} -->\n<p>App Development</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','13-revision-v1','','','2026-03-23 14:34:36','2026-03-23 14:34:36','',13,'http://localhost/beanchilling/?p=104',0,'revision','',0),(105,2,'2026-03-23 14:34:36','2026-03-23 14:34:36','<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"className\":\"hero section\"} -->\n<section><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"page-wrap hero-grid\"} -->\n<!-- wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"eyebrow\"} -->\n<p>GIS Coffee Profiling Platform</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1>BeanChilling helps farmers map farms and profile coffees with clarity.</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lede\"} -->\n<p>BeanChilling is an improved GIS-based application currently in development. The platform combines farm mapping and coffee profiling so coffee producers can make better field-level decisions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"btn-row\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"/beanchilling/showcase/\">Explore App Features</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"/beanchilling/imrad/\">Read Research Summary</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"hero-visual\"} -->\n<figure><img src=\"/beanchilling/wp-content/themes/beanchilling/assets/images/coffee_farm_main_bg.png\" alt=\"Coffee farm landscape used as BeanChilling preview image\" /></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"className\":\"section\"} -->\n<section id=\"application\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"page-wrap\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"eyebrow\"} -->\n<p>Application Purpose</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} -->\n<h2>What BeanChilling is built to solve</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"card-grid three-up\"} -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"card\"} -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"app-card-title-row\"} -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Scattered Farm Records</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"icon-placeholder app-card-icon app-title-icon\"} -->\n┬á\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Farm boundaries, crop details, and quality notes are often separated across notebooks and different tools.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"card\"} -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"app-card-title-row\"} -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Limited Geographic Insight</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"icon-placeholder app-card-icon app-title-icon\"} -->\n┬á\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Without GIS context, farmers and researchers struggle to analyze how location and terrain affect coffee characteristics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"card\"} -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"app-card-title-row\"} -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Hard-to-Track Profiles</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"icon-placeholder app-card-icon app-title-icon\"} -->\n┬á\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>BeanChilling structures coffee profiles in one place so farm records are easier to update, compare, and review over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"className\":\"section overview-section\"} -->\n<section id=\"app-overview\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"page-wrap\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"eyebrow\"} -->\n<p>Application Overview</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"overview-layout\"} -->\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"overview-intro\"} -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} -->\n<h2>BeanChilling Application Overview</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lede\"} -->\n<p>BeanChilling is a GIS-based platform designed to help coffee farmers map farm locations, organize coffee profile records, and monitor farm data through a practical and structured workflow.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"overview-highlights\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Built for:</strong> Coffee farmers, field validators, and local research teams.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What it combines:</strong> GIS farm mapping, coffee profiling, and monitoring summaries.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Why it matters:</strong> More reliable records and faster, evidence-based planning decisions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"overview-cta\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"/beanchilling/showcase/\">Explore Full Feature Walkthrough</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:gro